**Read:** [Chemical Reactor Analysis and Design Fundamentals — Rawlings and Ekerdt](../sources/Chemical-Reactor-Analysis-Rawlings-Ekerdt.lingua#r_7YQAV27Y3J0B537Z6K5HDN8H0A), the whole book revisited for the governing model and evidence chain; [Inorganic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../sources/Inorganic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_77Z8T5RFYFNNXZ7XKZFKPRKDKR), the complete relevant inorganic programme and cases; [Organic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../sources/Organic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_1ERYESBGNKCKMDY0NPHJKCVJG0), the complete relevant organic programme and cases; [Biochemical conversion of corn stover to ethanol — Humbird and colleagues](../sources/Biochemical-Ethanol-Design-Humbird.lingua#r_123G817BYJFAVYGA0ZVK3J5FJH), the entire integrated-design example as a comparison of explicit boundaries and assumptions.

Construct one coherent material/knowledge chain from actual feed and specification through chemical reactions, separations, qualification, operation, transfer, use interface and recovery. Read complete technical books/chapters and primary methods for every consequential stage. Reuse [General chemistry](../../general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V), [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5), [Reproducible computational work](../../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ), [Mineralogy and petrology — minerals, crystals, rock processes, and investigation](../../../../nature/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/Mineralogy-and-petrology.lingua#r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN), [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../../../engineering/mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA) and [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../../../../ergon/materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1) where their shared knowledge resolves a real question.

Independently derive species/element, inventory, phase, energy and representative rate/transport accounts. Reproduce substantial quantitative results with different methods and test them against primary observations. Connect product requirements and uncertainty to real choices of feed, reaction, purification, utility, equipment/material and operating arrangement.

Compare an actual alternative system on the same useful output, time and residual boundaries. Trace consequential impurities, co-products, water/energy, maintenance, skilled work and information at each transfer. Preserve which facts are observed, modeled, inferred, projected or unresolved.

**Work:** produce a complete technical/research-style argument with full bibliography, primary methods, derivations, inspectable original calculations, uncertainty, failures and defended alternatives. Have another reader reproduce a central result and challenge the weakest consequential assumption. Revise from evidence and identify the scientific/practical observation that would most improve or overturn the proposed system account.

**Continue:** [Investigate an unresolved industrial-chemistry question with independent scholarly evidence](Independent-industrial-chemical-scholarship-and-new-evidence.lingua#r_2AFDW6CYMWA4997TYYY2ZYNVRN).

**Return:** [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618).
